== Abstract ==

This BIP defines <code>_</code> as a placeholder for a Taproot internal key with no known signing key, for use in policies that require an unspendable key path. The key is derived from a synthetic [[bip-0032.mediawiki#extended-keys|BIP 32]] extended public key ''(H, chain_code)'', where ''H'' is the [[bip-0341.mediawiki#constructing-and-spending-taproot-outputs|BIP 341]] NUMS (Nothing Up My Sleeve) point. The chain code is a tagged hash of sorted, unique records containing the compressed public key and chain code of each extended public key referenced by the policy.

